  "description": "Provides robust background job processing for TuanZi applications through Hangfire, featuring:\n\t\t\t- Recurring and delayed job scheduling\n\t\t\t- Distributed job processing capabilities\n\t\t\t- Job persistence with automatic retries\n\t\t\t- Real-time job monitoring dashboard\n\t\t\t- Integration with TuanZi's dependency injection\n\t\t\t- Support for both fire-and-forget and batch jobs\n\t\t\t- Job continuation and chaining support\n\t\t\t- Configurable worker pools and queues",
